---

<Layout title="CV Green Fresh Cipanas — Supplier Sayur Mayur & Hasil Tani">

  <!-- SEO Schema Injection -->
  <script type="application/ld+json" set:html={JSON.stringify(schemaData)} />

  <!-- HERO SECTION (Deep Emerald Glow) -->
  <section id="hero" class="relative pt-12 pb-20 md:pt-28 md:pb-36 overflow-hidden bg-gradient-to-br from-emerald-950 via-emerald-900 to-slate-950 text-white select-none">
    <div class="absolute -top-40 -left-40 w-96 h-96 bg-emerald-500/20 rounded-full blur-3xl animate-pulse"></div>

    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 text-center relative z-10 animate-fade-in-up">
      
      <!-- Emblem Leaf SVG Glowing -->
      <div class="inline-flex items-center justify-center p-3 mb-4 md:mb-6 bg-white/10 backdrop-blur-xl rounded-2xl md:rounded-3xl border border-white/20 shadow-2xl hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-300">
        <svg class="w-12 h-12 md:w-16 md:h-16 text-emerald-400 drop-shadow-[0_0_15px_rgba(52,211,153,0.5)]" viewBox="0 0 100 100" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
          <path d="M50 10C50 10 20 35 20 62C20 78.5685 33.4315 92 50 92C66.5685 92 80 78.5685 80 62C80 35 50 10 50 10Z" fill="url(#leafGradient)"/>
          <path d="M50 25V85M50 50L32 38M50 62L68 50M50 40L65 30M50 72L35 62" stroke="#FFFFFF" stroke-width="3.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
          <circle cx="72" cy="25" r="5" fill="#34D399" class="animate-ping"/>
          <circle cx="72" cy="25" r="4" fill="#A7F3D0"/>
          <defs>
            <linearGradient id="leafGradient" x1="20" y1="10" x2="80" y2="92" gradientUnits="userSpaceOnUse">
              <stop stop-color="#10B981"/>
              <stop offset="1" stop-color="#047857"/>
            </linearGradient>
          </defs>
        </svg>
      </div>

      <div class="inline-block">
        <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3.5 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-500/20 border border-emerald-400/30 text-emerald-300 text-[11px] md:text-sm font-semibold mb-4 backdrop-blur-md shadow-lg">
          <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-emerald-400 animate-ping"></span> Min. Order 1.5 Juta • Termin TOP 7 Hari
        </span>
      </div>

      <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-6xl lg:text-7xl font-extrabold tracking-tight leading-tight max-w-5xl mx-auto text-transparent bg-clip-text bg-gradient-to-r from-white via-emerald-100 to-teal-200">
        CV Green Fresh Cipanas
      </h1>

      <p class="mt-3 text-xs sm:text-2xl text-emerald-100/80 max-w-3xl mx-auto font-light leading-relaxed">
        Pemasok Utama Sayur Mayur & Hasil Tani Cipanas. Garansi segar Grade A dengan <span class="font-semibold text-emerald-300">Termin B2B 7 Hari</span>.
      </p>

      <!-- App Action Buttons -->
      <div class="mt-6 md:mt-10 flex flex-row gap-3 justify-center items-center max-w-md mx-auto">
        <a href="#order-form" class="flex-1 px-5 py-3.5 rounded-xl md:rounded-2xl bg-emerald-400 text-slate-950 font-extrabold text-xs md:text-lg shadow-xl hover:bg-emerald-300 active:scale-95 transition-all text-center flex items-center justify-center gap-2">
          <svg class="w-4 h-4 md:w-5 md:h-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="2.5">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M13 10V3L4 14h7v7l9-11h-7z" />
          </svg>
          <span>Form Order WA</span>
        </a>
        <a href="#katalog" class="flex-1 px-5 py-3.5 rounded-xl md:rounded-2xl bg-white/10 border border-white/20 text-white font-bold text-xs md:text-lg backdrop-blur-md hover:bg-white/20 active:scale-95 transition-all text-center flex items-center justify-center gap-2">
          <svg class="w-4 h-4 md:w-5 md:h-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="2">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M16 11V7a4 4 0 00-8 0v4M5 9h14l1 12H4L5 9z"/>
          </svg>
          <span>Katalog ({products.length})</span>
        </a>
      </div>

    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- HIGHLIGHT FEATURE BARS (Mint Fresh Theme) -->
  <section class="py-6 md:py-10 bg-gradient-to-r from-emerald-900 via-teal-900 to-emerald-950 text-white border-y border-emerald-800 shadow-inner">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-4 gap-4 md:gap-6">
        <div class="p-4 rounded-2xl bg-white/10 backdrop-blur-md border border-white/10 text-center hover:bg-white/15 transition-all duration-300 group">
          <div class="text-emerald-300 font-extrabold text-base md:text-2xl group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform">Rp 1.500.000</div>
          <div class="text-[10px] md:text-xs font-semibold text-emerald-100/70 uppercase tracking-wider mt-1">Minimal Order (MOV)</div>
        </div>
        <div class="p-4 rounded-2xl bg-white/10 backdrop-blur-md border border-white/10 text-center hover:bg-white/15 transition-all duration-300 group">
          <div class="text-emerald-300 font-extrabold text-base md:text-2xl group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform">7 Hari TOP</div>
          <div class="text-[10px] md:text-xs font-semibold text-emerald-100/70 uppercase tracking-wider mt-1">Termin Pembayaran</div>
        </div>
        <div class="p-4 rounded-2xl bg-white/10 backdrop-blur-md border border-white/10 text-center hover:bg-white/15 transition-all duration-300 group">
          <div class="text-emerald-300 font-extrabold text-base md:text-2xl group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform">Bank BCA</div>
          <div class="text-[10px] md:text-xs font-semibold text-emerald-100/70 uppercase tracking-wider mt-1">Rekening Perusahaan</div>
        </div>
        <div class="p-4 rounded-2xl bg-white/10 backdrop-blur-md border border-white/10 text-center hover:bg-white/15 transition-all duration-300 group">
          <div class="text-emerald-300 font-extrabold text-base md:text-2xl group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform">QC Grade A</div>
          <div class="text-[10px] md:text-xs font-semibold text-emerald-100/70 uppercase tracking-wider mt-1">Sortir Tangan Pertama</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- SEKSI TENTANG KAMI, VISI & MISI (Warm Creamy/Soft Green Background) -->
  <section id="tentang-kami" class="py-12 md:py-24 bg-gradient-to-b from-emerald-50/60 via-teal-50/40 to-white border-b border-emerald-100">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-12 items-center">
        <!-- Text Deskripsi Tentang Kami -->
        <div class="space-y-6">
          <div>
            <span class="inline-block px-3.5 py-1 rounded-full bg-emerald-100 text-emerald-800 font-extrabold text-xs tracking-wider uppercase mb-2">Profil Perusahaan</span>
            <h2 class="text-2xl md:text-4xl font-extrabold text-slate-900 tracking-tight">Tentang CV Green Fresh Cipanas</h2>
          </div>
          
          <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed">
            <strong>CV Green Fresh Cipanas</strong> adalah perusahaan penyedia dan distributor komoditas pertanian, sayur mayur segar, jamur, umbi-umbian, serta bumbu rempah berkualitas tinggi yang berbasis di Pacet, Cianjur, Jawa Barat.
          </p>

          <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed">
            Berada langsung di kawasan dataran tinggi Cipanas & Puncak, kami bermitra erat dengan para petani lokal terpercaya untuk memastikan setiap komoditas dipanen dalam kondisi optimal, melewati proses penyortiran <em>Quality Control (QC) Grade A</em>, dan siap disalurkan secara konsisten ke mitra bisnis kami.
          </p>

          <div class="pt-2 grid grid-cols-2 gap-4 border-t border-emerald-200/60">
            <div class="p-3 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-emerald-100 shadow-sm">
              <p class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-extrabold text-emerald-600">60+</p>
              <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 font-medium">Varietas Komoditas Ready</p>
            </div>
            <div class="p-3 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-emerald-100 shadow-sm">
              <p class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-extrabold text-emerald-600">Grade A</p>
              <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 font-medium">Standar Penyortiran Segar</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Kartu Visi & Misi -->
        <div class="space-y-6 bg-white p-6 md:p-8 rounded-3xl border border-emerald-100 shadow-xl shadow-emerald-900/5">
          <div class="p-5 bg-emerald-50/70 rounded-2xl border border-emerald-200/70 hover:shadow-md transition-all duration-300">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-2">
              <div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-xl bg-emerald-600 text-white flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-sm shadow-md">👁️</div>
              <h3 class="text-lg font-extrabold text-slate-900">Visi Kami</h3>
            </div>
            <p class="text-slate-700 text-xs md:text-sm leading-relaxed">
              Menjadi mitra utama supplier hasil tani dan sayuran terdepan di Indonesia yang terpercaya dalam mutu kesegaran, kontinuitas pasokan, serta profesionalisme layanan B2B.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="p-5 bg-teal-50/70 rounded-2xl border border-teal-200/70 hover:shadow-md transition-all duration-300">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-3">
              <div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-xl bg-teal-600 text-white flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-sm shadow-md">🎯</div>
              <h3 class="text-lg font-extrabold text-slate-900">Misi Kami</h3>
            </div>
            <ul class="space-y-2 text-slate-700 text-xs md:text-sm leading-relaxed">
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
                <span class="text-teal-600 font-extrabold">•</span>
